    physiopathology: {"pt": "Extensão e gravidade são dimensões diferentes: doença distal pode exigir tratamento local, enquanto repercussão sistêmica muda o ambiente de cuidado. A resposta ao corticoide na internação precisa ser reavaliada objetivamente para não atrasar resgate ou cirurgia.", "es": "La extensión y gravedad son dimensiones distintas: la enfermedad distal puede requerir tratamiento local, mientras que la repercusión sistémica modifica el ámbito de atención. La respuesta al corticoide durante la internación debe reevaluarse objetivamente para no retrasar rescate o cirugía."},
    references: {"pt": ["[1] ACG. ACG guideline update: ulcerative colitis in adults. 2025. https://gi.org/journals-publications/ebgi/alkazzi_aug2025/", "[2] BSG. British Society of Gastroenterology guidelines on inflammatory bowel disease in adults. 2025. https://gut.bmj.com/content/74/Suppl_2/s1/", "[3] DailyMed. Mesalamine suppositories: prescribing information. 2025. https://dailymed.nlm.nih.gov/dailymed/drugInfo.cfm?setid=f458d574-7b5b-44f1-86be-8b18880dc67f", "[4] ASCRS. Surgical Management of Ulcerative Colitis. 2026. https://www.ascrsu.com/ascrs/view/ASCRS-Evidence-Based-Guidelines-and-Expert-Consensus/3982033/all/Surgical_Management_of_Ulcerative_Colitis__2026_", "[5] Pfizer / emc. Solu-Medrone 40 mg for injection: SmPC. 2025. https://www.medicines.org.uk/emc/product/1550/smpc"], "es": ["[1] ACG. ACG guideline update: ulcerative colitis in adults. 2025. https://gi.org/journals-publications/ebgi/alkazzi_aug2025/", "[2] BSG. British Society of Gastroenterology guidelines on inflammatory bowel disease in adults. 2025. https://gut.bmj.com/content/74/Suppl_2/s1/", "[3] DailyMed. Mesalamine suppositories: prescribing information. 2025. https://dailymed.nlm.nih.gov/dailymed/drugInfo.cfm?setid=f458d574-7b5b-44f1-86be-8b18880dc67f", "[4] ASCRS. Surgical Management of Ulcerative Colitis. 2026. https://www.ascrsu.com/ascrs/view/ASCRS-Evidence-Based-Guidelines-and-Expert-Consensus/3982033/all/Surgical_Management_of_Ulcerative_Colitis__2026_", "[5] Pfizer / emc. Solu-Medrone 40 mg for injection: SmPC. 2025. https://www.medicines.org.uk/emc/product/1550/smpc"]},
