    drugs: [],
    physiopathology: {"pt": "Detecção viral e lesão invasiva representam níveis diferentes de evidência. O contexto imunológico e a confirmação tecidual orientam a decisão de tratar. A eliminação renal do antiviral e a toxicidade hematológica explicam por que dose, função renal e hemograma precisam ser acompanhados juntos.", "es": "La detección viral y la lesión invasiva representan niveles distintos de evidencia. El contexto inmunológico y la confirmación tisular orientan la decisión de tratar. La eliminación renal del antiviral y toxicidad hematológica explican por qué dosis, función renal y hemograma deben seguirse juntos."},
    references: {"pt": ["[1] NIH. Cytomegalovirus Disease: Adult and Adolescent Opportunistic Infections. 2026. https://clinicalinfo.hiv.gov/sites/default/files/guidelines/documents/adult-adolescent-oi/cytomegalovirus-adult-adolescent-oi.pdf", "[2] BSG. British Society of Gastroenterology guidelines on inflammatory bowel disease in adults. 2025. https://gut.bmj.com/content/74/Suppl_2/s1/", "[3] DailyMed, official product labeling. Ganciclovir for Injection: prescribing information. 2026. https://dailymed.nlm.nih.gov/dailymed/lookup.cfm?setid=35addab5-09db-4f8a-9c69-6fbce33ecc37&version=6"], "es": ["[1] NIH. Cytomegalovirus Disease: Adult and Adolescent Opportunistic Infections. 2026. https://clinicalinfo.hiv.gov/sites/default/files/guidelines/documents/adult-adolescent-oi/cytomegalovirus-adult-adolescent-oi.pdf", "[2] BSG. British Society of Gastroenterology guidelines on inflammatory bowel disease in adults. 2025. https://gut.bmj.com/content/74/Suppl_2/s1/", "[3] DailyMed, official product labeling. Ganciclovir for Injection: prescribing information. 2026. https://dailymed.nlm.nih.gov/dailymed/lookup.cfm?setid=35addab5-09db-4f8a-9c69-6fbce33ecc37&version=6"]},
