    physiopathology: {"pt": "O estágio da doença modifica a utilidade das opções operatórias e não operatórias. A seleção para antibiótico isolado depende de excluir complicações e de garantir reavaliação. Após intervenção, a duração do antibiótico deve ser interpretada junto da efetividade do controle do foco.", "es": "El estadio de la enfermedad modifica la utilidad de opciones operatorias y no operatorias. La selección para antibiótico solo depende de excluir complicaciones y garantizar reevaluación. Tras una intervención, la duración del antibiótico debe interpretarse junto con la efectividad del control del foco."},
    references: {"pt": ["[1] WSES. Diagnosis and Treatment of Acute Appendicitis: 2025 WSES Jerusalem Guidelines. 2026. https://doi.org/10.1001/jamasurg.2025.6218", "[2] NIDDK. Appendicitis. 2021. https://www.niddk.nih.gov/health-information/digestive-diseases/appendicitis", "[3] Sartelli et al.; multisociety consensus. WSES/GAIS/SIS-E/WSIS/AAST global clinical pathways for intra-abdominal infections. 2021. https://doi.org/10.1186/s13017-021-00387-8", "[4] DailyMed. Ceftriaxone for Injection: prescribing information. 2023. https://dailymed.nlm.nih.gov/dailymed/fda/fdaDrugXsl.cfm?setid=7ea1db43-40fa-417b-8911-ae98092070a0", "[5] DailyMed. Metronidazole Injection: prescribing information. 2026. https://dailymed.nlm.nih.gov/dailymed/drugInfo.cfm?setid=9d762edb-12ac-429d-b1f0-7af5d3b909d4"], "es": ["[1] WSES. Diagnosis and Treatment of Acute Appendicitis: 2025 WSES Jerusalem Guidelines. 2026. https://doi.org/10.1001/jamasurg.2025.6218", "[2] NIDDK. Appendicitis. 2021. https://www.niddk.nih.gov/health-information/digestive-diseases/appendicitis", "[3] Sartelli et al.; multisociety consensus. WSES/GAIS/SIS-E/WSIS/AAST global clinical pathways for intra-abdominal infections. 2021. https://doi.org/10.1186/s13017-021-00387-8", "[4] DailyMed. Ceftriaxone for Injection: prescribing information. 2023. https://dailymed.nlm.nih.gov/dailymed/fda/fdaDrugXsl.cfm?setid=7ea1db43-40fa-417b-8911-ae98092070a0", "[5] DailyMed. Metronidazole Injection: prescribing information. 2026. https://dailymed.nlm.nih.gov/dailymed/drugInfo.cfm?setid=9d762edb-12ac-429d-b1f0-7af5d3b909d4"]},
